# gitleaks allowlist — one fingerprint per line.
#
# Fingerprint format depends on scan mode:
#   git mode (default, scans commit range):
#     <commit-sha>:<file-path>:<rule-id>:<line-number>
#   no-git mode (working-tree scan, used by CI on branch creation /
#                workflow_call when no diff range is available):
#     <file-path>:<rule-id>:<line-number>     (no commit SHA prefix)
#
# Generate by running gitleaks locally; copy the fingerprint verbatim
# from the offending finding in the gitleaks output / SARIF report.
#
# Examples (uncomment and replace with real findings):
# a1b2c3d4e5f6...:src/config/test-fixtures.ts:generic-api-key:42
# src/config/test-fixtures.ts:generic-api-key:42
